,0]],11.9,12,\"l\"]":0.287,"[[[\"BUSINESS MODEL\",10.5,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,1.6]],6,0,\"l\"]":0.297,"[[[\"When providers grow, TrustCraft grows.\",36,\"Inter\",true,-1.1]],9.5,42,\"l\"]":0.703,"[[[\"IN THE PRODUCT TODAY\",10.5,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,1.6]],3.2,0,\"l\"]":0.297,"[[[\"Customer pays\",12,\"Inter\",false,0]],2.4,0,\"l\"]":0.328,"[[[\"Rs 4,300\",20,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,0]],2.4,0,\"l\"]":0.453,"[[[\"TrustCraft fee (8%)\",12,\"Inter\",false,0]],2.4,0,\"l\"]":0.328,"[[[\"– Rs 344\",20,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,0]],2.4,0,\"l\"]":0.453,"[[[\"Professional receives\",12,\"Inter\",false,0]],2.4,0,\"l\"]":0.328,"[[[\"Rs 3,956\",20,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,0]],2.4,0,\"l\"]":0.453,"[[[\"The quotation builder already takes the platform fee out of every job, and shows the professional their payout before they send the price.\",12,\"Inter\",false,0]],2.6,17,\"l\"]":1.301,"[[[\"Not yet built, and not yet earning.\",11,\"Inter\",false,0]],5.2,0,\"l\"]":0.308,"[[[\"CUSTOMERS\",10.5,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,1.6]],3.1,0,\"l\"]":0.297,"[[[\"Free, always\",17,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,0]],3.1,0,\"l\"]":0.401,"[[[\"Describing a problem, seeing matches and reading trust evidence stays free. Charging the anxious side of a trust problem would break the product.\",12,\"Inter\",false,0]],3.21,17,\"l\"]":1.301,"[[[\"PROFESSIONAL · FREE TIER\",10.5,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,1.6]],3.1,0,\"l\"]":0.297,"[[[\"Basic presence\",17,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,0]],3.1,0,\"l\"]":0.401,"[[[\"A verified profile, discoverability, reputation and the full job lifecycle. Enough for a working professional to earn on the platform.\",12,\"Inter\",false,0]],3.21,17,\"l\"]":1.065,"[[[\"PROFESSIONAL · PAID TIER\",10.5,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,1.6]],3.1,0,\"l\"]":0.297,"[[[\"Business tools\",17,\"Inter SemiBold\",false,0]],3.1,0,\"l\"]":0.401,"[[[\"Richer presence, lead management, portfolio and reputation tooling, stronger discovery. Priced only once real providers tell us what they would pay for.\",1